command-description-slspawn-at =
    Spawns an entity at the given coordinates. Supports overrides.
command-description-slspawn-on =
    Spawns an entity on the given entity, at it's coordinates. Supports overrides.
command-description-slspawn-in =
    Spawns an entity in the given container on the given entity, dropping it at its coordinates if it doesn't fit. Supports overrides.
command-description-slspawn-attached =
    Spawns an entity attached to the given entity, at (0 0) relative to it. Supports overrides.
